       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LEAPYEAR.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 YEAR PIC 9(4) VALUE 2024.
       01 IS-LEAP PIC X VALUE "N".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF FUNCTION MOD(YEAR, 4) = 0 AND
              (FUNCTION MOD(YEAR, 100) NOT = 0 OR FUNCTION MOD(YEAR, 400) = 0)
               MOVE "Y" TO IS-LEAP
           END-IF
           DISPLAY YEAR " LEAP: " IS-LEAP
           STOP RUN.
